control: A change of scanner reopens a pass whose stored work another scanner decided
removes: a reopened first pass runs while it stays recorded as ended
packages: ./backfill/app ./backfill/internal/pass1 ./backfill/internal/pass2
tests: TestAChangeOfScannerMasksAndScansAgain
scheduled-count: no
integration: yes

